# Review regression (D8). Before: "● 准备" showed the moment G0 went down even where the hold
# would be refused (card full, battery at or below 3.45 V, 256 waiting, no ids), then the
# refusal followed: the capsule promised a memo that never came.
# Now: "● 准备" only where the hold records; the refusal alone otherwise.
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100
include ../common/demo_state.cpas
wait 1500
down g0
wait 150
shot ready  G0 down: ● 准备
up g0
wait 300
press `
wait 2700
bat 3400
wait 1500
down g0
wait 150
shot low  3.40 V: no ● 准备
wait 600
shot refused  the hold: 电量低，不能录音 (home stays as it was)
up g0
